                                "sense_id": "9097334d-dee4-38d9-85f4-a72606645feb",
                                "text": "[Huw] Jones was also involved in the second try, which started when [Finn] Russell received the ball near his own 22 and immediately detected that England’s defence was narrow, with Jonny May having strayed infield."
